{"unit_id":"zyn19940107__dsh-conductor#feature-1","repo":"zyn19940107/dsh-conductor","commit":"b402cebf00fb02833ebb4276a8c26afe23f3d859","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conductor 的「计划执行」功能：模型通过 refine_plan 提交验收标准和多个工作节点，插件运行节点并汇总结果。节点可批量调用工具，也可由 worker、spawner 或 forker 子代理处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:408","src/plan.ts:121"]}
